     "body": "<p>In fact it looks like the Mulgara TQL endpoint doesn't in fact produce SPARQL output but a TQL XML output - <a href=\"http://docs.mulgara.org/itqlcommands/select.html#o193\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://docs.mulgara.org/itqlcommands/select.html#o193</a></p>",
     "created": "06/Dec/11 9:57 AM",
     "id": "12140",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10980/comment/12140",
     "updateAuthor": {
